{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261017/photo/bkn-20261017064410929-1017_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261017083535\"/><p>事發在上水欣翠花園一單位。</p><p>今日(17日)清晨6時許，上水吉祥街8號欣翠花園一單位男子報案，指其11歲兒子在單位房間床上懷疑暈倒。救援人員到場證實事主已不治。警員經初步調查後，相信事件無可疑，案件列「屍體發現」，稍後召仵工到場將遺體舁送殮房，死因有待驗屍後確定。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-17T02:58:43.261633+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":139,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T22:44:10+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-17T04:37:52.102029+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-17T02:57:44.639346+00:00","content_hash":"a272b75feb9ec0a5fefdcf40573c167ccca602dc0063142f2ecbaeb112b40751","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}